// Hybrid native-bridge corpus — legacy tests/pass/run hybrid/native-bridge
// cases migrated to Foundation `Test` constructs. HYBRID-only (the @Native +
// @Runtime mix is rejected on pure vm/llvm); runs through the pure-Kira test
